{
  $schema: 'https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json',
  extends: [
    'config:recommended',
  ],
  mode: 'full',
  timezone: 'Europe/Berlin',
//  schedule: [
//    'after 2am and before 6am',
//  ],
  'docker-compose': {
    enabled: true,
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '(^|/)[^/]*compose[^/]*\\.ya?ml$',
    ],
  },
  dockerfile: {
    enabled: true,
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '(^|/)Dockerfile$',
    ],
  },
  customManagers: [
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)traefik\\.ya?ml$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'moduleName:\\s*github\\.com\\/(?<depName>[^\\/]+\\/[^\\s]+)\\s+version:\\s*(?<currentValue>v[^\\s]+)',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: 'github-releases',
    },
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)ansible\\/minikube-install\\.ya?ml$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'minikube_release_version:\\s*"(?<currentValue>v[^"]+)"',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: 'github-releases',
      depNameTemplate: 'kubernetes/minikube',
    },
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)ansible\\/minikube-install\\.ya?ml$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'kubectl_release_version:\\s*"(?<currentValue>v[^"]+)"',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: 'github-releases',
      depNameTemplate: 'kubernetes/kubernetes',
    },
    {
      // Alpine-Release der Firewall-VM (vm/firewall/variables.tf).
      // Datasource docker, weil die Alpine-Images auf Docker Hub für jedes
      // Patch-Release getaggt werden - eine eigene Release-Datasource für
      // dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org gibt es nicht.
      customType: 'regex',
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)vm\\/firewall\\/variables\\.tf$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'variable "alpine_version"[\\s\\S]*?default\\s*=\\s*"(?<currentValue>[0-9.]+)"',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: 'docker',
      depNameTemplate: 'alpine',
      versioningTemplate: 'semver',
    },
  ],
  branchPrefix: 'renovate/',
  additionalBranchPrefix: '{{parentDir}}-',
  packageRules: [
    {
      description: 'Docker: Aktiviert und Digest-Pinning',
      matchCategories: [
        'docker',
      ],
      enabled: true,
      pinDigests: true,
    },
    {
      description: 'Metadaten-Fix für Docker Images',
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      extractVersion: '^v?(?<version>[0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+){1,3})',
      matchPackageNames: [
        'grafana/grafana',
      ],
      sourceUrl: 'https://github.com/grafana/grafana',
    },
    {
      description: 'Metadaten-Fix für Docker Images',
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      extractVersion: '^v?(?<version>[0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+){1,3})',
      matchPackageNames: [
        'traefik',
        'docker.io/library/traefik',
      ],
      sourceUrl: 'https://github.com/traefik/traefik',
    },
    {
      description: 'Alle Non-Major Updates: Automatische PRs mit sofortigem Automerge',
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'patch',
        'minor',
        'pin',
        'digest',
      ],
      automerge: true,
      automergeType: 'pr',
      prCreation: 'immediate',
      ignoreTests: true,
      prBodyNotes: [
        '{{#if releases}}### 🧾 Versionsdetails\n\n{{#each releases}}- {{#if url}}[{{version}}]({{{url}}}){{else}}{{version}}{{/if}}\n{{/each}}{{/if}}',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: 'Major-Updates: PR mit Review erforderlich',
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      automerge: false,
      prCreation: 'immediate',
      prBodyNotes: [
        '### ⚠️ Major Update - Breaking Changes möglich\n\n{{#if releases}}{{#each releases}}#### {{#if url}}[{{version}}]({{{url}}}){{else}}Version {{version}}{{/if}}\n{{#if url}}📦 [Release Notes]({{{url}}}){{/if}}\n{{#if body}}\n\n{{{body}}}\n\n{{/if}}{{/each}}{{else}}Keine detaillierten Release Notes gefunden. Bitte manuell prüfen.{{/if}}',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: 'Datenbanken Major-Updates: PR mit Review (Kompatibilität prüfen!)',
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      automerge: false,
      prCreation: 'immediate',
      groupName: null,
      prBodyNotes: [
        '### 🗄️ Datenbank Major-Update - Kompatibilität prüfen!\n\n⚠️ **Vor dem Merge prüfen:**\n- Backup vorhanden?\n- Breaking Changes im Datenformat?\n\n{{#if releases}}{{#each releases}}#### {{#if url}}[{{version}}]({{{url}}}){{else}}Version {{version}}{{/if}}\n{{/each}}{{/if}}',
      ],
      matchPackageNames: [
        '/(?:^|/)postgres$/',
        '/(?:^|/)mariadb$/',
        '/(?:^|/)mysql$/',
        '/(?:^|/)redis$/',
        '/(?:^|/)mongo$/',
        '/(?:^|/)valkey$/',
        '/(?:^|/)memcached$/',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: 'OctoPrint: IMMER PR mit Review (manuelle Prüfung erforderlich)',
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchPackageNames: [
        'octoprint/octoprint',
      ],
      automerge: false,
      prCreation: 'immediate',
      prBodyNotes: [
        '### 🖨️ OctoPrint Update - Manuelle Prüfung erforderlich!\n\n{{#if releases}}{{#each releases}}#### {{#if url}}[{{version}}]({{{url}}}){{else}}Version {{version}}{{/if}}\n{{/each}}{{/if}}',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: 'Traefik Plugins: IMMER PR (manuelle Deployment erforderlich)',
      matchManagers: [
        'custom.regex',
      ],
      matchFileNames: [
        'traefik/config/traefik.yml',
      ],
      automerge: false,
      prCreation: 'immediate',
      prBodyNotes: [
        '### 🔌 Traefik Plugin Update\n\n⚠️ **WICHTIG: Manuelles Deployment erforderlich!**\n\n{{#if releases}}{{#each releases}}#### {{#if url}}[{{version}}]({{{url}}}){{else}}Version {{version}}{{/if}}\n{{/each}}{{/if}}',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: 'Firewall-VM: Alpine-Update immer mit Review',
      matchManagers: [
        'custom.regex',
      ],
      matchFileNames: [
        'vm/firewall/variables.tf',
      ],
      automerge: false,
      prCreation: 'immediate',
      prBodyNotes: [
        '### 🧱 Alpine-Update der Firewall-VM\n\n⚠️ Der Image-Name geht in den Volume-Namen ein: Nach dem Merge baut der **nächste `terraform apply` die VM neu**. Das ist ein Wartungsfenster – währenddessen haben DMZ und Cluster kein Gateway.\n\nDanach fällig:\n- `vm/firewall/verify/assert-ruleset.sh`\n- `sudo vm/firewall/verify/egress-test.sh`',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: 'Docker Compose Updates - Gruppierung',
      matchManagers: [
        'docker-compose',
      ],
      groupName: '{{parentDir}}',
      additionalBranchPrefix: '{{parentDir}}-',
      commitMessagePrefix: '[{{parentDir}}]',
    },
  ],
  prConcurrentLimit: 10,
  prHourlyLimit: 0,
  platformAutomerge: false,
  semanticCommits: 'enabled',
  dependencyDashboard: true,
  dependencyDashboardTitle: '🔄 Renovate Dashboard - Docker Updates',
  fetchChangeLogs: 'pr',
  prBodyDefinitions: {
    Change: '{{#if displayFrom}}{{displayFrom}} → {{/if}}{{#if releaseNotesUrl}}[{{displayTo}}]({{{releaseNotesUrl}}}){{else}}{{#if changelogUrl}}[{{displayTo}}]({{{changelogUrl}}}){{else}}{{#if sourceUrl}}[{{displayTo}}]({{{sourceUrl}}}/releases){{else}}{{displayTo}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if compareUrl}}<br/>[Compare]({{{compareUrl}}}){{/if}}',
  },
}
